>## Render a single atom; the . metacharacter renders as [\s\S] to preserve newline-inclusive 'any'.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term atom = λa.cases(regex.Atom){literal=λc.escapeLiteral c, any=λ`_`."[\\s\\S]", anchorStart=λ`_`."^", anchorEnd=λ`_`."$", group=λg.strings.concat ["(", alternation g, ")"], class=λcc.characterClass cc} a
