>## Render a literal code point in top-level context, backslash-escaping PCRE/ECMA metacharacters.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term escapeLiteral = λc.let isMeta := lists.foldl (λacc,m.logic.or acc (equality.equal c m)) false [46:int32, 94:int32, 36:int32, 42:int32, 43:int32, 63:int32, 40:int32, 41:int32, 91:int32, 93:int32, 123:int32, 125:int32, 124:int32, 92:int32] in logic.ifElse isMeta (strings.concat2 "\\" (printCodePoint c)) (printCodePoint c)
